# cv-builder conventions

- Do not add test files (`*.test.ts`, `*.spec.ts`, `__tests__/`, etc.) unless the user explicitly asks for tests.
- Do not add code comments unless the user explicitly asks for comments or the logic is genuinely non-obvious and cannot be made clear through naming alone.
- When generating CVs, send all existing CV versions to the model so it can pick the best phrasing and facts across them.
- Generated CV slugs must not use a `-tailored` suffix; use numeric suffixes only for collisions (`-2`, `-3`, …).
